<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>If you place multiple light probes in a level, outdoor or indoor, they will all show exactly the same reflection. This happens even if the probes are separated by terrain like walls or mountains that would make them show different reflections.
</p><p>It is unclear how the toolset chooses the light probe to use.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>No workaround. Multiple light probes do not work.
</p>
